{
  "key": 8217,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Why don’t you try dressing up your\n",
        "Pokémon now?\r",
        "We have a Fitting Room on\n",
        "the second floor.\r",
        "Dress up your Pokémon nicely with\n",
        "Accessories!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00001",
      "en_US": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00002",
      "en_US": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00003",
      "en_US": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "This is the Pokémon Lottery Corner.\r",
        "If your drawn number matches the\n",
        "ID No. of any of your Pokémon,\r",
        "starting with the far right digit,\n",
        "you will receive a fabulous gift.\r",
        "Would you like to draw a Pokémon\n",
        "Loto Ticket?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "You’ve already drawn a Loto Ticket\n",
        "today. Please come back tomorrow."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh. I see.\n",
        "Please do visit us again."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Please draw a Loto Ticket.\r",
        "...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "Your Loto Ticket number is {STRVAR_1 54, 0, 0}.\r",
        "Now, let’s see if it matches the\n",
        "ID No. of any of your Pokémon.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Congratulations!\r",
        "The ID No. of your team’s\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0} matches your Loto\\fTicket number!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "Congratulations!\r",
        "The ID No. of your PC-boxed\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0} matches your Loto\\fTicket number!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m sorry.\n",
        "You didn’t get a match..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "The last digit matched, so you\n",
        "win the fourth prize!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00013",
      "en_US": [
        "You gained a new Backdrop for use\n",
        "in Fitting Rooms."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00014",
      "en_US": [
        "The last two digits matched, so you\n",
        "win the third prize!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "The last three digits matched, so you\n",
        "win the second prize!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00016",
      "en_US": [
        "The last four digits matched, so you\n",
        "win the first prize!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00017",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, my goodness, all five digits\n",
        "matched!\r",
        "You’ve won the jackpot prize!\n",
        "This is just so incredible!\r",
        "...Oh, I’m sorry! Your prize!\n",
        "I got carried away there.\r",
        "Here you go!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00018",
      "en_US": [
        "...Oh?\n",
        "You seem to have no room for this.\r",
        "Please make room in your Bag and\n",
        "then let me know."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00019",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\n",
        "Yes, I’ve been expecting you.\r",
        "This is the prize we’ve been holding\n",
        "for you. Here you go!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00020",
      "en_US": "Please do visit again."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00021",
      "en_US": [
        "They keep records of things like\n",
        "how many battles you’ve won in a row,\\for how many Pokémon you’ve caught.\r",
        "You can check everyone’s records\n",
        "up on the third floor."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00022",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m going to get commercials shown\n",
        "on TV.\r",
        "They’ll attract more customers to\n",
        "the department store."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00023",
      "en_US": [
        "The Trainers that gather over there\n",
        "are looking for battles.\r",
        "That corner used to be for karaoke,\n",
        "but now it’s all battling!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00024",
      "en_US": [
        "More than singing!\n",
        "More than dancing!\r",
        "I love Pokémon!\n",
        "So, shall we battle?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00025",
      "en_US": [
        "I’ll let you join my fan club if you\n",
        "can beat me!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00026",
      "en_US": [
        "Aww... That’s heartbreaking...\n",
        "I’m an Idol, too..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00027",
      "en_US": [
        "Well, that’s me and my Pokémon!\n",
        "I hope you’ll support us!\r",
        "Just so you know, our latest single\n",
        "is called “Jigglin’ Pokémon Wub!”"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00028",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m working on a story.\n",
        "Can you battle me?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00029",
      "en_US": "Join me for a live report!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00030",
      "en_US": [
        "Press coverage denied...\n",
        "But you’re so intriguing!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00031",
      "en_US": [
        "Interviews are about taking the\n",
        "initiative."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00032",
      "en_US": [
        "I’ve spotted a charismatic Trainer!\n",
        "Is it OK to go for the scoop?\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00033",
      "en_US": [
        "As a professional cameraman, I always\n",
        "go for the best shot!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00034",
      "en_US": [
        "That’s a downer...\r",
        "I thought I’d found a Trainer and\n",
        "Pokémon who’d shine on camera."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00035",
      "en_US": [
        "The lively expressions on you and\n",
        "your Pokémon’s faces...\r",
        "It makes for some great TV!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00036",
      "en_US": [
        "Are we all ready to have some fun?\n",
        "I sure am! Aren’t you having fun?!\\fLet’s make it fun! OK?!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00037",
      "en_US": [
        "OK, how shall we do this?\n",
        "Shall we do something fantastical?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00038",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, how shall I say this...?\n",
        "It makes me all lonely, I say..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00039",
      "en_US": [
        "A clown’s makeup is a face that’s\n",
        "crying while laughing.\r",
        "It defines what we do!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00040",
      "en_US": [
        "Two Pokémon! If you had two Pokémon,\n",
        "we’d get a great shot here."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00041",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh! You’re ready for a battle\n",
        "with us?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00042",
      "en_US": [
        "You’re live on camera, but try\n",
        "to act natural, OK?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00043",
      "en_US": [
        "OK, that’s how it is, huh.\n",
        "Can’t do anything about that."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00044",
      "en_US": [
        "I’d like to take that footage and\n",
        "have it broadcast worldwide."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00045",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, no. What we really want to see\n",
        "is you in action with two Pokémon!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00046",
      "en_US": [
        "Giggle!\n",
        "Will you have a battle with us?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00047",
      "en_US": [
        "We’ll check you out thoroughly as\n",
        "a Trainer!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00048",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, too bad!\n",
        "I wanted to check out your Pokémon!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00049",
      "en_US": [
        "I lost but I’m totally thrilled!\n",
        "We made a wonderful spectacle!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00050",
      "en_US": [
        "Po-Po-Pokémon!\r",
        "I want to become more like\n",
        "a PIKACHU! Will you battle me?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00051",
      "en_US": "Pi-pikachu!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00052",
      "en_US": "Pikachu!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00053",
      "en_US": [
        "I need to get more into the\n",
        "character of a Pokémon..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00054",
      "en_US": [
        "Come on, let’s show off our Pokémon!\n",
        "Let’s do battle, kiddo!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00055",
      "en_US": [
        "Your spirit’s vibes... I can feel\n",
        "you’ve got rock in your veins!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00056",
      "en_US": [
        "Now, that is so lame.\n",
        "You have to let your passion burn!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0852_C01R0201_00057",
      "en_US": [
        "Rock is about your spirit!\n",
        "Battling is about spirit, too!\\fThat’s why a battle is rock!"
      ]
    }
  ]
}